  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000s7w6](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000s7w6) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 155.688 depth occurred on Mar 26 2026 13km W of Managua. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 12.1114 longitude -86.3881. It impacted 695347 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
